OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FThe mother of a sailor missing for 40
OL,7,Fyears has called on the man she
OL,8,Fbelieves responsible for his
OL,9,Fdisappearance to reveal what happened
OL,10,Fto her son.
OL,12,FSimon Parkes, from Bristol, was last
OL,13,Fseen in December 1986 when the Royal
OL,14,FNavy ship he was serving on, HMS
OL,15,FIllustrious, was docked in Gibraltar.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
