OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FHis disappearance was part of
OL,7,Finvestigations by Hampshire police
OL,8,Finto the past of Allan Grimson, a
OL,9,Fformer petty officer, after he was
OL,10,Fjailed for life in 2001 for the
OL,11,Fmurders of navy rating Nicholas Wright
OL,12,Fand barman Sion Jenkins.
OL,14,FGrimson, who on Monday was found
OL,15,Fguilty of sexually assaulting four
OL,16,Fmales, has always denied being
OL,17,Finvolved in the disappearance but
OL,18,FMargaret Parkes has urged him to "tell
OL,19,Fus what happened to Simon".
OL,26,@zD@bOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FShe told the Daily Mirror: "How do you
OL,7,Fget in to the head of a man like that?
OL,8,FWe want him to tell us what he knows,
OL,9,Fwhere Simon's body is, we would want
OL,10,Fthat, but he's in denial now."
OL,12,FHampshire police announced in December
OL,13,F2025 that it had closed its
OL,14,Finvestigation into the death.
OL,26,@nD@\OUrD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FMrs Parkes said: "I was very
OL,7,Fdisappointed that the investigation
OL,8,Fwas dropped. Now we want to have an
OL,9,Finquest so we can also be given a
OL,10,Fdeath certificate after nearly 40
OL,11,Fyears. We want someone to say that
OL,12,FSimon is dead.
OL,14,F"I'm 80 now so we probably don't have
OL,15,Fmuch longer if you think of it that
OL,16,Fway. We want answers."
OL,18,FGrimson had also been serving on the
OL,19,Faircraft carrier when it docked at
OL,20,FGibraltar.
OL,26,@nD@ROUvD@AOUxD@VO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
