OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FMr Parkes, a radio operator, had gone
OL,7,Fashore on December 12 1986 ` the same
OL,8,Fdate in December that Grimson killed
OL,9,FMr Wright and Mr Jenkins in separate
OL,10,Fyears, more than a decade later.
OL,12,FAnnouncing the end of the
OL,13,Finvestigation in December, Detective
OL,14,FSuperintendent Adam Edwards said:
OL,15,F"Officers have worked tirelessly to
OL,16,Finvestigate the disappearance of Simon
OL,17,FParkes and to find answers for his
OL,18,Fdevastated family.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,F"This information has been thoroughly
OL,7,Fexplored and following a complex
OL,8,Finvestigation which has included
OL,9,Fadvice from the CPS, we are now
OL,10,Fdrawing our enquiries to a close.
OL,12,F"The full circumstances surrounding
OL,13,FSimon's disappearance still remain
OL,14,Funknown, however police will continue
OL,15,Fto support the ongoing coronial
OL,16,Fprocess."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@IO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
