OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,403,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1785332898
OL,3,CMother of missing sailor calls on
OL,4,Csuspect to reveal what happened
OL,6,FOn Monday, jurors at Winchester Crown
OL,7,FCourt convicted 66-year-old Grimson,
OL,8,Fof Hollesley, Suffolk, for the rape
OL,9,Fand indecent assault of a teenage
OL,10,Fnaval rating, and indecent assault
OL,11,Fcharges against three other male
OL,12,Fcomplainants, dating between February
OL,13,F1994 and November 1999.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
